notes.content:
First of all, we'd like to thank you for the warm welcome you've given the game, with some great sales! And we're glad you like it!

Initial feedback has enabled us to improve the game, with some rebalancing and bug fixes:


 French tanks used by the AI will no longer wander all over the battlefield map;
 Connections between different sectors (regions) have been slightly transformed in some places, notably with the creation of a ford connection, enabling the AI to better manage the troops under its command, while conferring greater fluidity of movement to the units available to players;
 Playing card corrections;
 Correction of a minor graphic bug on the battlefield map;
 Two additional option cards for the Viet Minh player in the hypothetical campaign (giving the Viet Minh player two extra regiments against Dien Bien Phu).


Note: the designer of SGS Battle for : Dien Bien Phu, also creator of SGS NATO's Nightmare, will resume work on the NATO update on Monday March 17, 2025!
